### Scenario 8: AI Scanner

Student uploads homework photo.

Backend validates it.

AI provider processes it.

Student receives an explanation.

Missing provider credentials produce an honest error, not a fake answer.

### Scenario 9: Result Security

Teacher submits marks.

Authorized approval occurs.

Result publishes.

Only authorized students and guardians can view it.

### Scenario 10: Universal Add

Each role opens its dashboard.

